        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank I. Cobb, Joseph Pulitzer\n- Roles: journalist, editorial writer, newspaper publisher\n- Companies: St. Louis Post-Dispatch, New York World\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Pulitzer was born as József Pulitzer on April 10, 1847.\n- Frank I. Cobb was born on August 6, 1869.\n- Frank I. Cobb was an American journalist who worked primarily as an editorial writer from 1896 until his death.\n- Joseph Pulitzer was a newspaper publisher of the St. Louis Post-Dispatch and the New York World.\n- Joseph Pulitzer died on October 29, 1911.\n- Frank I. Cobb died on December 21, 1923.",
